RUINA2-LOVE_AND_HATE.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()}*X damage to ALL enemies.
Deals {firstThresholdBonus:diff()}% more damage if X is {firstThreshold:diff()} or higher.{IfUpgraded:show:
Additionally deals {secondThresholdBonus:diff()}% more damage if X is {secondThreshold:diff()} or higher.}

RUINA2-SWORD_SHARPENED.description:
Apply {WeakPower:diff()} [gold]Weak[/gold] and [gold]Vulnerable[/gold].
If played on an enemy from your [gold]Hand[/gold] {PlayThreshold:diff()} times, [gold]Stun[/gold] the enemy and [gold]Exhaust[/gold] instead.{IfUpgraded:show:
Shuffle this card into your [gold]Draw Pile[/gold].}

RUINA2-REGRET.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage again for each [gold]Status[/gold] or [gold]Curse[/gold] in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:
(Hits {CalculatedHits:diff()} extra {CalculatedHits:plural:time|times})|}

RUINA2-JUSTITIA.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
If the enemy's HP is at or below {HPThreshold:diff()}%, kill them instead.{InCombat:
(Enemy's HP threshold is {CalculatedHP:diff()}.)|}
